.TH ALI-UPDATE 1 "October 2026" "ALI Linux 1.4.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ali-update \- upgrade the Debian base underneath ALI Linux
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ali-update
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs
.B apt update
followed by a full upgrade. This moves the Debian base only;
the ALI layer (apps, daemons, branding) moves with
.BR ali-update-version (1).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ali-update-version (1),
.BR ali-mirrors (1)
